body:
@Fantety Please make sure you all have the latest version of Nvidia GPU drivers for your hardware.

You can search your GPU on https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/drivers/

Make sure to click "Find" and not pick the "GeForce Game Ready Driver" link that gets added when you start typing, for some reason it's showing the latest and greatest for Nvidia 20x+ series, and not properly matching older GPUs. But the "Find" button works.
